 clear, verified and commercially usable compliance package.</p></div></div></div></section>

<section id="cbam-faq" class="cbam-anchor-target border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24"><div class="max-w-[48rem] mx-auto px-3 sm:px-4 lg:px-5"><div class="text-center mb-10"><p class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-eurogold-600 mb-2">Answers</p><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight" style="color:#0f172a">Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div><div class="space-y-3"><details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 shadow-sm open:shadow-md open:border-eurogold-400/30 transition-all"><summary class="heading-font cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-bold text-euro-600 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span>Is Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism the same as CE Marking?</span><span class="text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"></i></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">No. CE Marking is related to product conformity and safety requirements. Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism is related to embedded carbon emissions in selected imported goods.</p></details><details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 shadow-sm open:shadow-md open:border-eurogold-400/30 transition-all"><summary class="heading-font cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-bold text-euro-600 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span>Who is responsible for filing Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism reports?</span><span class="text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"></i></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">The EU importer or authorised declarant is responsible for filing. However, exporters must provide accurate emissions data to support the importer.</p></details><details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 shadow-sm open:shadow-md open:border-eurogold-400/30 transition-all"><summary class="heading-font cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-bold text-euro-600 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span>Why should exporters get emissions data verified?</span><span class="text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"></i></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">Verification improves data credibility, reduces importer queries and supports smoother EU market access.</p></details><details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 shadow-sm open:shadow-md open:border-eurogold-400/30 transition-all"><summary class="heading-font cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-bold text-euro-600 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span>Which sectors are covered?</span><span class="text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"></i></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">The main sectors include cement, iron and steel, aluminium, fertilisers, hydrogen and electricity.</p></details><details class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 shadow-sm open:shadow-md open:border-eurogold-400/30 transition-all"><summary class="heading-font cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-bold text-euro-600 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span>Can you help if our emissions data is incomplete?</span><span class="text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"></i></span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">Yes. We can review your current data, identify gaps and help you prepare a structured data collection system.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="pb-16 sm:pb-20 lg:pb-24 bg-white" aria-labelledby="cbam-footer-cta-heading"><div class="max-w-[92rem] mx-auto px-3 sm:px-4 lg:px-5"><div class="cbam-cta-footer-bar relative overflow-hidden rounded-[1.25rem] sm:rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/[0.08] px-6 py-9 sm:px-10 sm:py-10 lg:px-12 lg:py-12" style="background-color:#030a16"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 cbam-cta-mesh opacity-[0.85]" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 cbam-cta-constellation" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-16 top-1/2 h-[22rem] w-[22rem] -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/[0.09] blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between lg:gap-10"><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:text-left gap-6 sm:gap-7 lg:gap-10 min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="shrink-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782368029/eurocert/cbam-trust-badge.png.png" alt="Verification trust badge" width="112" height="112" decoding="async" class="h-[5.25rem] w-[5.25rem] sm:h-[5.5rem] sm:w-[5.5rem] lg:h-[7rem] lg:w-[7rem] rounded-full object-contain bg-black shadow-[0_0_0_3px_rgba(212,168,67,0.4),0_12px_40px_-8px_rgba(212,168,67,0.45)]"/></div><div class="min-w-0 max-w-3xl"><h2 id="cbam-footer-cta-heading" class="heading-font text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-[1.65rem] xl:text-4xl font-bold text-white leading-[1.2] tracking-tight mb-2 sm:mb-3">Verified data builds trust and reduces compliance risk.</h2><p class="text-white/75 text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">Turn emissions data into a commercial advantage.</p></div></div><div class="flex justify-center lg:justify-end shrink-0 w-full lg:w-auto"><a href="/contact/" class="cbam-transition-all-custom inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-9 sm:px-10 py-3.5 sm:py-4 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl font-bold text-center text-[0.95rem] sm:text-base tracking-tight hover:-translate-y-0.5 whitespace-nowrap" style="background-color:#D4A843;color:#030a16;box-shadow:0 18px 42px -14px rgba(212,168,67,0.5)">Speak to an Expert<span class="text-lg leading-none font-black" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></div></div></section>
